{"meta":{"id":"access-modifier","category":"it/syntax/java/class","title":"접근 제한자 · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"public · protected · default · private, final, getter/setter 캡슐화","tags":["java","f-class","f-access"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">접근 제한자 · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> public · protected · default · private, final, getter/setter 캡슐화</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">접근 제한자</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">문법</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">접근 가능 범위</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>public</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">어디서든</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>protected</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">같은 패키지 + 자식 클래스</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>(default, 생략)</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">같은 패키지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>private</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">해당 클래스 내부</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>final</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">필드: 재할당 불가 / 메서드: 재정의 불가 / 클래스: 상속 불가</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">캡슐화 — private 필드 + getter/setter</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public class Account {\r\n    private long balance;\r\n    private final String owner;\r\n\r\n    public long getBalance() { return balance; }\r\n    public void deposit(long amount) {\r\n        if (amount &lt;= 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException();\r\n        balance += amount;\r\n    }\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Java 의 private 는 실행 시점에도 막힌다(리플렉션 제외). TS 의 private 는 컴파일 때만 검사</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 접근 제한자, Lombok @Getter</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/class/access-modifier","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"class","title":"클래스","path":"it/syntax/java/class"}],"hasImage":false}